  "details": "I'm using an animation Override on HandOpen (grip button on Vive) to emit a particle which works fine.\n\nBut when I grab an object in-game (using the trigger button mapped to FIST), it causes the HandOpen override to play.\n\nThis only occurs when you actually grab an object/interact with something. If you pull the trigger to do the fist animation without an object in reach, it does not trigger HandOpen.",
